('Hotel','35',35,'PrivateTransfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Nizami Street in Baku is an absolute must-visit! The vibrant atmosphere, beautifully lit streets, and a mix of modern and historic architecture create an unforgettable experience. Itâ$™s perfect for a leisurely stroll, shopping at high-end boutiques, or enjoying a meal at one of the many cafes and restaurants. The street truly comes alive in the evening, with its lively vibe and gorgeous lighting. Whether youâ$™re a tourist or a local, Nizami Street offers something for everyone. +                  Old City tour starts from Shamakhi Gates followed by Old city below places (Photo stop) -Shamakhi Gates -Sculptures of Azim Azimzadehâ$™s -Caravanserai of Bukhara -Caravanserai of Multani -Maidenâ$™s Tower -Bazar Square -Miniature Booksâ$™ Museum -Shirvanshahsâ$™ Palace + Walking tour starts along the Baku Boulevard followed by: -Mini Venice of Baku   -Carpet Museum -Deniz Mall    -Ferries Wheel ride    -Carpet Museums   -Boat cruise    -Cristal Hall   -Biking Area',NULL,NULL,'Guides (A)',12.0),
